    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-english-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime English Classes Theme is a tailored solution for educators, language schools, private tutors, online English academies, coaching centers, ESL instructors, and training institutes offering English language courses. Designed for modern e-learning environments, it supports structured linguistics-based learning experiences for diverse learners. It helps institutions deliver speaking courses, business communication training, and functional English programs through an engaging digital platform. Ideal for showcasing virtual classes, grammar and vocabulary training, pronunciation practice, and exam preparation for IELTS, TOEFL, and Cambridge English. The layout supports schedules, course modules, testimonials, and interactive workshops. Built for usability, it includes booking systems for live or self-paced learning. Fully responsive, it ensures smooth access across all devices. With customization options, educators can adapt it for beginner to advanced learners. It empowers tutors and institutes to build a strong online presence and inspire global learners."
    },
